# TinyML - SIH 26172

## Role
**R3 - TinyML Embedded**

This module is responsible for deploying the custom Keyword Spotting (KWS)
model on an ESP32 under the SIH resource constraints.

## Objective

Build an efficient TinyML inference pipeline:

```text
Trained KWS Model
        ↓
TensorFlow Lite
        ↓
INT8 Quantization
        ↓
TFLite Micro
        ↓
ESP32
        ↓
Keyword Detection
        ↓
Trigger Audio Streaming
```

## Responsibilities

- ESP32 development and firmware
- TensorFlow Lite model conversion
- INT8 quantization
- TensorFlow Lite Micro deployment
- Tensor arena / RAM management
- Flash footprint optimization
- Inference-time optimization
- Embedded benchmarking
- Integration with the KWS and networking modules

## SIH Constraints

| Metric | Target |
|---|---|
| RAM | < 256 KB |
| Idle CPU usage | < 10% |
| Keyword detection | High true-positive rate |
| False activations | Near zero |
| Detection-to-stream latency | As low as possible |

